SUMMARY:Good Grief Group
DESCRIPTION:The Good Grief Group offers group members a safe and sacred space to grieve circumstances in our own lives and the lives of our loved ones. As we talk about our grief\, we are both held and heard by each other. All members are present to one another’s grief\, as well as our own. It is a sharing-caring experience where we give and receive loving support.\nOpen to new members. \nContact Trevor Johnson or Iris Hardin if interested.
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/good-grief-group/2026-11-13/
LOCATION:1 Sandburg Hall/Kitchen\, 1 Edwin Pl\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:*Social Groups - LOVING
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://uuasheville.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2nd-Fri-Good-grief-Group-930-AM-in-SH-Trevor.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Trevor Johnson":MAILTO:Connect@UUAsheville.org
END:VEVENT
